<title>GREECE: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>basketball matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Athens: Panathinaikos (Greece) 79 Barcelona (Spain) 75</p>
<p>(halftime 38-40)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - Nikos Economou 22, Michael Koch 17, Byron</p>
<p>Dinkins 16</p>
<p>Barcelona - Arturas Karnisovas 17, Javier Fernandez 11,</p>
<p>Roger Estejer 11</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Seville: Sevilla (Spain) 61 Pau Orthez (France) 69</p>
<p>(halftime 37-35)</p>
</text>
